==Invited attendees==
The NBA annually invites around 15–20 players to sit in the so-called "green room", a special room set aside at the draft site for the invited players plus their families and agents. When his name is called, the player leaves the room and goes up on stage. Other players who are not invited are allowed to attend the ceremony. They sit in the stands with the fans and walk up the stage when or if they are drafted. On June 8, the NBA announced only 9 invited players to the event (all of whom played collegiately this year).<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.slamonline.com/nba/nine-draft-candidates-sent-green-room-invites/|title=Nine Prospects Receive NBA Draft Green Room Invitations|date=June 9, 2019|website=SlamOnline.com|access-date=June 14, 2019|archive-date=July 16, 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210716201107/https://www.slamonline.com/nba/nine-draft-candidates-sent-green-room-invites/|url-status=live}}</ref> Four days later, the NBA invited seven more players to the event, bringing the number of invites up to 16. Two more players were invited the next day, bumping the number up to 18. On June 14, two more players were invited to this year's event, bringing up the total invites to 20.<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.slamonline.com/nba/one-green-room-invite-remains-ahead-of-nba-draft/ |title=NBA Extends Green Room Invites to 23 Players |first=Austin |last=Kent |date=June 14, 2019 |access-date=June 26, 2021 |url-status=live|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190615030609/https://www.slamonline.com/nba/one-green-room-invite-remains-ahead-of-nba-draft/ |archive-date=June 15, 2019 }}</ref> Five days later, three more players received last minute invitations for this year's NBA draft, bringing the total number of invites up to 23.<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.espn.com/nba/story/_/id/26975761/nba-invites-list-20-prospects-2019-draft-green-room |title=NBA invites 23 prospects to 2019 draft green room |last=Givony |first=Jonathon |work=ESPN |date=June 19, 2019 |access-date=June 26, 2021 |url-status=live|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190615105808/https://www.espn.com/nba/story/_/id/26975761/nba-invites-list-20-prospects-2019-draft-green-room |archive-date=June 15, 2019 }}</ref> On the night of the event, [[Matisse Thybulle]] was revealed as a last-minute invite, bumping up the final invite list to 24.<ref>{{cite web |url=https://heavy.com/sports/2019/06/nba-draft-green-room-which-players-invited-attending/ |title=NBA Draft Green Room Invites: Which Players Are in Attendance? |website=heavy.com |last=Dodge |first=Sam |date=June 20, 2019 |access-date=June 26, 2021 |url-status=live|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190626053227/https://heavy.com/sports/2019/06/nba-draft-green-room-which-players-invited-attending/ |archive-date=June 26, 2019 }}</ref> The following players (listed alphabetically) were confirmed as invites for the event:

